            "content": "That's tough. Why have you been so tired lately?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Work. It’s just... I used to be able to handle it, but now it feels like climbing a mountain. I just want to go home and sleep, but then I’m wide awake at 2 am. It’s frustrating."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Has the work load changed for you?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "No, it's the same. Maybe less. But I just can't keep up. I'm just... I don't know how I used to do it."
