            "content": "Yeah. That sounds right. I just... I feel like I'm losing my grip on everything."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "How does that make you feel?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Scared. Like I’m standing on the edge of a cliff and I don't know how to get back down."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Have you been feeling hopeless or you do have anything in mind to cope with this feeling?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Just... waiting. I don't know what I'd even do. I don't have the energy to try anything else."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Have you gone through a slump like this before/"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Yeah. It happened after my divorce. I just felt... useless. But I got through it. I just... I don't know how to get through this one."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Were you stuck the way you are now?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "No. I didn't have to choose between sleep and a panic attack every day. I didn't lose my spark."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "That sounds challenging. How have you been feeling about yourself?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "I don't know. I used to be the person who could handle anything. Now I'm just... I don't know if I'm even capable of being a good person anymore."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Have you been expressing you tiredness through crying or talking to others?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "I don't cry. I just... I get quiet. I don't want to talk about it. I just want to disappear."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Is there anything that makes you feel happy right now?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Nothing. I used to love music, but it just sounds loud now. I don't get the same rush. It’s all just... noise."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "How are people around you reacting to your mental health?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "They just tell me to 'snap out of it' or 'toughen up.' They don't get it. They just don't understand."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Do you feel like you can or feel like a burden?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Both. I don't want to be a burden, but I can't handle it on my own."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Have you had any self-harming thoughts?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Yes. I... I don't want to say it out loud. I just want it to be over."
